• {b}The {link:unstable-sentinel}Unstable Sentinel{/link}.{/b} A guardian construct that no longer obeys.
• {b}The {link:shade-of-the-archmage}Shade of the Archmage{/link}.{/b} The ghost of one of {link:dalaran}Dalaran{/link}'s own magi.
